		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Iridescent green scales with a frilled orange crest that raises when angry.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 28, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 staff +4 (1d4) or 2 venomous spit (near) +4 (1d8 + poison) or 1 spell +4, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Snuff (WIS Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Extinguish all light sources (even magical) within near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunblind</strong>. Blinded in bright light.</p><p></p><p><strong>Troglodyte Stench</strong>. Living creatures within near, CON 12+ or DISADV for 5 rounds. Immune to stench for 24 hours once successful. Shield of Filth (WIS Spell). DC 11. AC becomes 14 for 5 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
